 |0 - 0| = 3000. Since both lotteries have a 0 outcome, the only difference is in the 6000 vs 3000. The sum of differences is 3000. So the reason is applicable and would consider this sum to be the same for both lotteries in terms of outcome differences. Therefore, the reason is applicable to the problem.",
